 "avatar": "32a37f2f330ace1cca693543ed842d04f46840e8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Arma 3 Apex Full Review:\n\nThe Arma series is well known for great gameplay and good mechanics. \n\nI find that Arma 3 has got great potencial to be an even better game. Arma is full of minor bugs, it could be an game engine issue. For example: Stuck in the wall bugs, Ramdom dying bugs and many more.\n\nNext, I would like to address that to enjoy the game you need to pay for most of the DLCs. The developers could either: reduce the cost of the DLCs or Remove them and make them into one or two packages for a lower cost.\n\nBack to gameplay: The game has got great graphics that amaze me. The map sizes are great but it feels like the devs put the same buildings with only colour variation on them. It feels lazy that the devs have decided to do this, that is one of the things that they could improve in Arma 4.\n\nReviewing the Apex DLC,\nIt has improvements to the Eden Editor which makes creating maps even better.\n\nI am a person who likes to create my own scenarios and this game has nailed it! \nThe guns are also slightly lazily made. They are just variations of Pre-made Guns.\n\nAgain, I don't want to pay £9.99 just for 3 tanks (Tanks DLC). It very stupid for the devs to do this just to make money.\n\nThere is a lack of vehicles within the game including the DLCs. For example there is only 2 Tanks for the NATO Side. The Two tanks are the same but slightly different stats.\n\nThere is alot of criticism in this review but the game feels unfinished, it needs custom models rather than Pre-Made and just altered slightly.\n\nAt the end of this review, the game gets a very nice 7.9/10", "timestamp_created": 1547567066, "timestamp_updated": 1547567066, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}